    "explanation": "### Step-by-Step Gantt Chart Execution (SRTF):\n- **$t = 0$**: $P_1$ arrives with burst 8. Starts execution. Remaining: $P_1(8)$.\n- **$t = 1$**: $P_2$ arrives with burst 4. Remaining of $P_1 = 7$. Since $4 < 7$, $P_1$ is preempted and $P_2$ gets the CPU.\n- **$t = 2$**: $P_3$ arrives (burst 9). Remaining: $P_2(3), P_1(7), P_3(9)$. $P_2$ continues.\n- **$t = 3$**: $P_4$ arrives (burst 5). Remaining: $P_2(2), P_4(5), P_1(7), P_3(9)$. $P_2$ continues.\n- **$t = 5$**: $P_2$ finishes. Completion Time $CT(P_2) = 5$.\n  - Active ready queue: $P_4(5), P_1(7), P_3(9)$. Smallest remaining burst is $P_4$ (5).\n- **$t = 10$**: $P_4$ finishes. $CT(P_4) = 10$.\n  - Active ready queue: $P_1(7), P_3(9)$. Smallest remaining burst is $P_1$ (7).\n- **$t = 17$**: $P_1$ finishes. $CT(P_1) = 17$.\n  - Active ready queue: $P_3(9)$. $P_3$ executes.\n- **$t = 26$**: $P_3$ finishes. $CT(P_3) = 26$.\n\n### Turnaround and Waiting Times:\n- **Turnaround Time ($TAT = CT - AT$)**:\n  - $P_1$: $17 - 0 = 17\\text{ ms}$\n  - $P_2$: $5 - 1 = 4\\text{ ms}$\n  - $P_3$: $26 - 2 = 24\\text{ ms}$\n  - $P_4$: $10 - 3 = 7\\text{ ms}$\n- **Waiting Time ($WT = TAT - BT$)**:\n  - $P_1$: $17 - 8 = 9\\text{ ms}$\n  - $P_2$: $4 - 4 = 0\\text{ ms}$\n  - $P_3$: $24 - 9 = 15\\text{ ms}$\n  - $P_4$: $7 - 5 = 2\\text{ ms}$\n- **Average Waiting Time**:\n  $$\\text{Avg WT} = \\frac{9 + 0 + 15 + 2}{4} = \\frac{26}{4} = 6.5\\text{ ms}$$",
