    "text": "A counting semaphore $S$ is initialized to $7$. A total of $20P$ (wait) operations and $k$ $V$ (signal) operations are executed in some order. If the resulting value of the semaphore is $2$, what is the value of **$k$**?",
    "answer": 15,
