    "text": "Consider two processes $P_1$ and $P_2$ with shared integer variable `turn` initialized to 0:\n```c\n// Code for P1:             // Code for P2:\nwhile (turn != 0);          while (turn != 1);\n// Critical Section         // Critical Section\nturn = 1;                   turn = 0;\n// Remainder Section        // Remainder Section\n```\nWhich of the following conditions is **VIOLATED** by this solution?",
