    "text": "Which of the following conditions for deadlock is prevented by imposing a strict total ordering of all resource types and requiring that each process requests resources in strictly increasing order of enumeration?",
    "options": [
      "Mutual Exclusion",
      "Hold and Wait",
      "No Preemption",
      "Circular Wait"
    ],
