    "explanation": "**Step-by-step SSTF Path:**\\n- Head starts at $100$. Queue: $\\{20, 75, 90, 110, 120, 180\\}$.\\n1. From $100$: Closest is $90$ ($|100-90|=10$) or $110$ ($|100-110|=10$). Tie-break pick $110$ (or $90$):\\n   - Go to $110$: distance $= 10$. Current $= 110$.\\n2. From $110$: Closest is $120$ ($|110-120|=10$).\\n   - Go to $120$: distance $= 10$. Current $= 120$.\\n3. From $120$: Closest is $90$ ($|120-90|=30$) vs $180$ ($|120-180|=60$).\\n   - Go to $90$: distance $= 30$. Current $= 90$.\\n4. From $90$: Closest is $75$ ($|90-75|=15$).\\n   - Go to $75$: distance $= 15$. Current $= 75$.\\n5. From $75$: Closest is $20$ ($|75-20|=55$).\\n   - Go to $20$: distance $= 55$. Current $= 20$.\\n6. From $20$: Only $180$ remains.\\n   - Go to $180$: distance $= |20-180| = 160$.\\n\\n- Total head movement $= 10 + 10 + 30 + 15 + 55 + 160 = 280$ cylinders.\\n\\nWait, what if at step 1 we visited $90$ first?\\n- $100 \\to 90$ ($10$)\\n- $90 \\to 75$ ($15$)\\n- $75 \\to 110$ ($35$) vs $20$ ($55$) $\\implies 110$ ($35$)\\n- $110 \\to 120$ ($10$)\\n- $120 \\to 180$ ($60$)\\n- $180 \\to 20$ ($160$)\\n- Total $= 10 + 15 + 35 + 10 + 60 + 160 = 290$.\\n\\nWait, what if from $75$ we go to $20$?\\n- $100 \\to 90 (10) \\to 75 (15) \\to 20 (55) \\to 110 (90) \\to 120 (10) \\to 180 (60) = 240$.\\n\\nLet's trace carefully: from 100, distances are:\\n- $|100-110| = 10$, $|100-90|=10$.\\nIf we take $110$ (dist 10), then $120$ (dist 10), from $120$ next closest is $90$ (dist 30, since $|120-180|=60$), from $90$ next closest is $75$ (dist 15), from $75$ next closest is $20$ (dist 55), then $180$ (dist 160). Total $= 10 + 10 + 30 + 15 + 55 + 160 = 280$.",
