    "explanation": "**Step 1: NewReno recovery trace.**\n- RTT 1: 3 Dup ACKs trigger Fast Retransmit of packet 2. Packet 2 arrives at receiver; receiver returns Partial ACK acknowledging packet 4.\n- RTT 2: Partial ACK immediately triggers retransmission of packet 5 without timeout. Packet 5 arrives at receiver; receiver returns Full ACK acknowledging packet 8, exiting Fast Recovery.\n- Total duration $= 2\\text{ RTTs}$.",
