    "text": "Consider the recurrence relation:\n$$T(n) = 4T(n/2) + n^2 \\log_2 n, \\quad T(1) = 1$$\nIf $T(n) = \\Theta(n^k \\log_2^p n)$, what is the integer value of $k + p$?",
    "answer": 4,
