    "text": "Consider the recurrence relation defined for $n \\ge 2$ with base case $T(2) = 1$:\n$$T(n) = 2 T\\left(\\frac{n}{2}\\right) + \\frac{n}{\\log_2 n}$$\nWhich of the following functions represents the tight asymptotic bound $\\Theta(T(n))$?",
