    "text": "Consider the recurrence relation for an algorithm with unequal subproblem partitions:\n$$T(n) = T\\left(\\frac{n}{3}\\right) + T\\left(\\frac{2n}{3}\\right) + n$$\nwith base cases $T(n) = \\Theta(1)$ for $n \\le 3$. What is the tight asymptotic time complexity $\\Theta(T(n))$?",
