    "text": "Consider the 1D Dynamic Programming recurrence:\n$$dp[i] = \\min_{0 \\le j < i} \\{ dp[j] + m_j \\cdot x_i + c_j \\}$$\nwhere queries $x_i$ and slope parameters $m_j$ are monotonically decreasing. Using the Convex Hull Trick (CHT) with a double-ended queue (deque), what is the optimized total time complexity to compute all $dp[1 \\dots n]$?",
