    "text": "Consider the following 2D array declaration in C:\n```c\nint a[3][4] = { {1, 2, 3, 4}, {4, 3, 2, 1}, {7, 8, 9, 0} };\n```\nWhat is the value of the expression `*(*(a + 1) + 2)`?",
