    "text": "Consider inserting the following sequence of keys into an initially empty **AVL tree** in order:\n$$21, 26, 30, 9, 4, 14, 28, 18, 15$$\nWhat is the key value at the **root** of the AVL tree after all insertions and necessary rotations are completed?",
    "answer": 18,
