    "text": "Consider the following recursive function executed on a binary search tree:\n```c\nint transform(struct Node *root) {\n    if (root == NULL) return 0;\n    int left_sum = transform(root->left);\n    int right_sum = transform(root->right);\n    \n    struct Node *temp = root->left;\n    root->left = root->right;\n    root->right = temp;\n    \n    root->val += (left_sum - right_sum);\n    return root->val + left_sum + right_sum;\n}\n```\nLet the initial BST be constructed by inserting keys in the order: `[20, 10, 30, 5, 15]`.\n\nWhat is the integer value returned by `transform(root)`?",
