    "text": "In an AVL tree, let a Left-Right (LR) double rotation be performed at node $z$ with left child $y$ and $y$'s right child $x$. Prior to rotation, the heights of the subtrees are:\n- Height of $z$'s right subtree $T_4 = h$\n- Height of $y$'s left subtree $T_1 = h$\n- Height of $x$'s left subtree $T_2 = h - 1$\n- Height of $x$'s right subtree $T_3 = h$\n\nAfter the LR rotation completes (making $x$ the new root of this subtree), what is the balance factor $\\text{BF}(y) = \\text{height}(\\text{left}) - \\text{height}(\\text{right})$ of node $y$?",
