    "text": "Consider the schedule $S$ over transactions $T_1, T_2, T_3$:\n$$S: r_1(X); \\; w_2(X); \\; w_1(X); \\; w_3(X);$$\nWhich of the following statements is TRUE regarding schedule $S$?",
