      "Complementation: If $\\alpha \\twoheadrightarrow \\beta$, then $\\alpha \\twoheadrightarrow (R - (\\alpha \\cup \\beta))$",
      "Replication: If $\\alpha \\to \\beta$, then $\\alpha \\twoheadrightarrow \\beta$",
      "Coalescence: If $\\alpha \\twoheadrightarrow \\beta$ and $\\delta \\to \\gamma$ such that $\\gamma \\subseteq \\beta$ and $\\delta \\cap \\beta = \\emptyset$, then $\\alpha \\to \\gamma$",
      "Pseudotransitivity for MVDs: If $\\alpha \\twoheadrightarrow \\beta$ and $\\beta \\twoheadrightarrow \\gamma$, then $\\alpha \\twoheadrightarrow \\gamma$"
