    "text": "Let $\\Sigma = \\{a, b\\}$. Consider the following two regular expressions:\n$$R_1 = (a + b)^* a (a + b)^* b (a + b)^*$$\n$$R_2 = (a + b)^* a b (a + b)^*$$\nWhich of the following statements is TRUE?",
