    "type": "NAT",
    "explanation": "Let us determine the Myhill-Nerode equivalence classes (states of minimal DFA):\n1. State $q_0$ (Start / Empty string $\\epsilon$): Waiting for first symbol. Transitions: on 0 $\\to q_0'$, on 1 $\\to q_1'$.\nWait, let's track the suffixes of valid strings that can build towards forbidden patterns $101$ or $010$:\n- $s_0 = \\epsilon$ (initial)\n- $s_1 = \\text{ends in } 0$ (not preceded by 01; e.g. from start or multiple 0s)\n- $s_2 = \\text{ends in } 1$ (not preceded by 10; e.g. from start or multiple 1s)\n- $s_3 = \\text{ends in } 01$ (danger of matching 010 on '0')\n- $s_4 = \\text{ends in } 10$ (danger of matching 101 on '1')\n- $s_{dead} = \\text{Trap/Dead state}$ (contains 101 or 010)\n\nLet's trace transitions:\n- From $s_0$:\n  - on 0 $\\to s_1$\n  - on 1 $\\to s_2$\n- From $s_1$ (suffix 0):\n  - on 0 $\\to s_1$\n  - on 1 $\\to s_3$ (now suffix is 01)\n- From $s_2$ (suffix 1):\n  - on 1 $\\to s_2$\n  - on 0 $\\to s_4$ (now suffix is 10)\n- From $s_3$ (suffix 01):\n  - on 0 $\\to s_{dead}$ (would create 010)\n  - on 1 $\\to s_2$ (suffix is now 11 $\\equiv 1$)\n- From $s_4$ (suffix 10):\n  - on 1 $\\to s_{dead}$ (would create 101)\n  - on 0 $\\to s_1$ (suffix is now 00 $\\equiv 0$)\n- From $s_{dead}$:\n  - on 0,1 $\\to s_{dead}$\n\nAccepting states are $\\{s_0, s_1, s_2, s_3, s_4\\}$ (5 accepting states) plus 1 dead state $s_{dead}$.\nTotal number of states in minimal DFA = $5 + 1 = 6$.",
