    "text": "Consider the following SDT with synthesized attribute `val`:\n$$\\begin{aligned}\nS &\\to E & \\{ \\text{print}(E.\\text{val}); \\} \\\\\nE &\\to E_1 + T & \\{ E.\\text{val} = E_1.\\text{val} + T.\\text{val}; \\} \\\\\nE &\\to T & \\{ E.\\text{val} = T.\\text{val}; \\} \\\\\nT &\\to T_1 * F & \\{ T.\\text{val} = T_1.\\text{val} * F.\\text{val}; \\} \\\\\nT &\\to F & \\{ T.\\text{val} = F.\\text{val}; \\} \\\\\nF &\\to \\text{num} & \\{ F.\\text{val} = \\text{num}.\\text{lexval}; \\}\n\\end{aligned}$$\nWhat value is printed for the input expression `$3 * 4 + 5 * 2$`?",
