    "text": "Consider the following loop in C:\n```c\nfor (i = 0; i < n; i++) {\n    x = a + b;\n    arr[i] = x * i;\n}\n```\nWhich optimization technique can hoist the assignment `x = a + b` outside the loop pre-header?",
