    "text": "In Sparse Conditional Constant Propagation (SCCP) on SSA form, the algorithm maintains two worklists: `CFGWorkList` (executable control-flow edges) and `SSAWorkList` (SSA value edges).\nConsider the SSA program:\n$$\\begin{aligned}\nB_1:& \\; x_1 = 5; \\; y_1 = 10; \\; \\mathbf{if} \\; x_1 > 0 \\; \\mathbf{goto} \\; B_2 \\; \\mathbf{else} \\; B_3; \\\\\nB_2:& \\; z_1 = x_1 + y_1; \\; \\mathbf{goto} \\; B_4; \\\\\nB_3:& \\; z_2 = 100; \\; \\mathbf{goto} \\; B_4; \\\\\nB_4:& \\; z_3 = \\phi(z_1, z_2); \\; \\mathbf{return} \\; z_3;\n\\end{aligned}$$\nWhat is the final constant value determined for $z_3$ at the end of SCCP execution?",
