    "answer": 5,
    "explanation": "### Boat & Stream Equations:\n1. Upstream speed: $u = v_b - v_s = \\frac{24}{6} = 4\\text{ km/h}$.\n2. Downstream speed: $d = v_b + v_s = \\frac{24}{4} = 6\\text{ km/h}$.\n3. Speed of boat in still water:\n   $$v_b = \\frac{d + u}{2} = \\frac{6 + 4}{2} = 5\\text{ km/h}$$.\n\nThus, speed is **5**.",
    "source": "GATE CSE 2012 Q6"
